abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalization accompanying Political Entrenchment and the Persistence
  of Economic Sanctions (titled Entrenchment and the Persistence of Sanctions
  until 2026-10-19, Government Horizons and the Persistence of Sanctions until
  2026-10-11, and Why Do Sanctions Persist? A Dynamic Political-Economy Model
  with Forward-Looking Governments until 2026-09-21). The MIT License covers
  the Lean sources, scripts and documentation; the paper sources are not
  covered by it.
